  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1501.13 Summary of Registration ‑ Statement Filing. An insurer required to file an annual registration statement pursuant to RSA 401-B:4 is also required to furnish information required on Form C, hereby made a part of these rules.\n\nSource. #1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5652, eff 7-1-93; ss by #6985, eff 5-1-99, EXPIRED: 5-1-07\n\nNew. #8910, eff 7-1-07; ss by #10450, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13692, eff 7-21-23",
